            "target_entity_instance": "Continental",
            "target_entity_type": "ClimateZone",
            "paragraph": "Earlier GSstart is evident across the boreal zone, while most of the temperate zone show delayed GSstart (Fig. 1b, see Fig. S1 for the climate zones over North America).",
